<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 17:39:15 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“特洛伊木马”：加州最富有的 1% 人缴纳了该州近一半的所得税。第 40 号提案的反对者警告说，亿万富翁税可能会影响到其他所有人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/california-billionaire-wealth-tax-prop-40-trojan-horse-income-wealth-assets/</link><description>州立法机构可以以三分之二的票数修改第 40 号提案，但法院也会对任何将范围扩大到所有纳税人的尝试进行权衡。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2298607164-e1791550700777.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 16:55:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/california-billionaire-wealth-tax-prop-40-trojan-horse-income-wealth-assets/</guid></item><item><title>福来鸡让人类留在得来速餐厅，而麦当劳测试人工智能点餐并在法庭上为单独的定价算法辩护</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/chick-fil-a-mcdonalds-ai-drive-thru-ordering-pricing-lawsuit/</link><description>人工智能可以减轻餐厅的工作量，也可以带来新的麻烦。从正确获取订单到菜单价格的确定，都存在风险。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2167158686-e1791563423875.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 16:41:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/chick-fil-a-mcdonalds-ai-drive-thru-ordering-pricing-lawsuit/</guid></item><item><title>“一条漏洞百出的管道”：到 2035 年，每年将新增 170 万个贸易工作岗位，专家们正忙着想办法填补这些工作岗位</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/leaky-pipeline-1-7-million-trade-jobs-open-annually-2035/</link><description>一份新报告发现，老龄化的劳动力和 Z 世代的保留问题使得填补不断扩大的技术贸易职位变得更加困难。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2287872780-e1791561394565.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 16:38:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/leaky-pipeline-1-7-million-trade-jobs-open-annually-2035/</guid></item><item><title>“你决定逃避他们”：前汇丰银行家“显然有能力支付”，因逃避 7,800 美元的票价而被禁止从事金融工作</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/former-hsbc-banker-finance-ban-fare-evasion/</link><description>约瑟夫·莫洛伊不仅被禁止在受监管的金融服务领域工作，而且还被禁止在铁路运营商工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2283765219-e1791481427469.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 07:10:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/former-hsbc-banker-finance-ban-fare-evasion/</guid></item><item><title>迪士尼出价 200 万美元让一位 13 岁的男孩在《狮子王》中演唱。他妈妈拿了 10 万美元加上版税。 34年后他仍然得到报酬</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/disney-offered-13-year-old-2-million-to-sing-in-the-lion-king-mom-rejected-royalties-jason-weaver-simba/</link><description>杰森·韦弗的妈妈曾经支持艾瑞莎·富兰克林。她把赌注押在特许权使用费上，而不是迪士尼的现金上——而她所支付的金额比他放弃的 200 万美元还要多。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2279792972-e1791472168746.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/disney-offered-13-year-old-2-million-to-sing-in-the-lion-king-mom-rejected-royalties-jason-weaver-simba/</guid></item><item><title>三天后，埃隆·马斯克再次失去了他的万亿富翁身份，但他说“无论如何，这不像是存在银行账户中”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/elon-musk-lost-trillionaire-status-again-after-three-days-says-not-like-its-sitting-in-bank-account-anyway/</link><description>SpaceX创始人埃隆·马斯克几天之内损失了630亿美元，第二次跌出万亿富翁俱乐部。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1258741760-e1791560014838.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 15:39:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/elon-musk-lost-trillionaire-status-again-after-three-days-says-not-like-its-sitting-in-bank-account-anyway/</guid></item><item><title>杰夫·贝佐斯表示，由于人工智能，每周工作 3 天和更多的单一收入家庭即将到来：“招聘人员将会变得很困难”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/amazon-billioniare-jeff-bezos-predicts-three-day-workweek-single-income-households-thanks-to-ai/</link><description>即使在亚马逊裁员 30,000 人之后，杰夫·贝佐斯仍预测人工智能将极大地提高生产力，以至于需要工作的人会减少，从而造成劳动力短缺。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2282053641-e1791556482586.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 15:36:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/amazon-billioniare-jeff-bezos-predicts-three-day-workweek-single-income-households-thanks-to-ai/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 正在聘请一名政治项目负责人来监督 2028 年大选前的“总统参与”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/anthropic-presidential-engagement-program-hiring-political-lead-2028-elections/</link><description>“我们希望两党中每一位认真的候选人和当选官员都能了解这项技术以及妥善治理它的理由。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297781315-e1791491801228.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 23:14:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/anthropic-presidential-engagement-program-hiring-political-lead-2028-elections/</guid></item><item><title>格温·肖特韦尔 (Gwynne Shotwell) 向特朗普账户承诺 SpaceX 提供 3 亿美元，这向亿万富翁展示了一种捐献自己公司股票的节税方式</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/gwynne-shotwell-300-million-spacex-pledge-to-trump-accounts-billionaire-tax-smart-new-way-to-give-away-their-own-company-stock/</link><description>财政部的新规定允许超级富豪将自己公司的股票送给数百万儿童，只要礼物是通过慈善机构捐赠的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2201117693-e1791490924863.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 07:04:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/gwynne-shotwell-300-million-spacex-pledge-to-trump-accounts-billionaire-tax-smart-new-way-to-give-away-their-own-company-stock/</guid></item><item><title>在 Bending Spoons 找工作没有奖金、没有花哨的头衔，而且还会有警告——反正有 80 万人申请了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/getting-a-job-at-bending-spoons-comes-with-no-bonus-no-fancy-title-and-a-warning-800000-people-applied-anyway/</link><description>这家市值 180 亿美元的意大利科技公司的人力运营主管解释了为何警告新员工其工作“并不适合所有人”，并分享了为何仍有如此多的人想加入的原因。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2283612244_2880x1920.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 14:33:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/09/getting-a-job-at-bending-spoons-comes-with-no-bonus-no-fancy-title-and-a-warning-800000-people-applied-anyway/</guid></item></channel></rss>